            "id": 152119,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Return a clear signal when quantity text can't be converted.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Handle only invalid integer text and return a failure signal without inventing a quantity.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"parse_quantity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(value)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" int(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Exception\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"TypeError\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>ValueError</code>, followed by <code>None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
