          {
            "title": "Check for None",
            "id": 152120,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check the parser's result before processing the order.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity = parse_quantity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity \" /><text value=\"is\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Skip order&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"== 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>is None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pass invalid integer text and check the failure signal so the caller prints <code>Skip order</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"quantity.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"quantity = parse_quantity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;many&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity \" /><text value=\"is\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"None\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Skip order&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"== 0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"many\"</code>, followed by <code>is None</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
