            "id": 152123,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which handler hides both expected conversion failures and unexpected bugs?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>pass</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>return None</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>return 0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>pass</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which handler silently catches both invalid integer text and an unexpected undefined-variable error?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">except: pass</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">except ValueError: return None</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">except TypeError: return 0</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">except Exception: raise</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick except: pass.</p></body></html>",
